# === 🔴 КОНФІДЕНЦІЙНИЙ КОД UTD — НІКОЛИ В GIT ===
# Вихідники комерційних Shopify-тем UTD (Fuse, Lucent, Theme 7 та ін.).
# Власник позначив їх як цілком таємні. Репозиторій camp — ПУБЛІЧНИЙ.
*.liquid
**/lucent*/
**/fuse*/
**/adastra*
theme-source/
themes-private/
*.fig

# CAMP-90: generated per build from NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_MODE, never committed.
apps/web/public/_headers
apps/web/public/maplibre/
apps/web/src/generated/

# CAMP-103: local backups of the data we cannot download again.
#
# 🔴 The default location is OUTSIDE the repository ($HOME/CampTribe-backups)
# on purpose — this repository is public, and a backup holds every review,
# every human correction and every computed context we own. This line is
# the second line of that defence, not the first.
CampTribe-backups/
*.csv.gz

# CAMP-107. Somebody else's data, not our source.
#
# 🔴 The DATAtourisme regional files are 11-64 MB each and this
# repository is public. `fetch-regions.mjs` writes them outside the tree
# by default, so this line is the second line of that defence rather
# than the first — but the first is a default, and a default is one
# `--out .` away from a 64 MB commit that cannot be taken back out of a
# public history. No CSV is tracked today (checked 24.09.2026); if one
# ever needs to be, un-ignore that path explicitly.
*.csv
